{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1477","id":4013189465,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vNGlZ","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1477","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1477.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1477.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1477","number":1477,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix auth refresh-session revocation on credential changes","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis patches the custom JWT auth flow so credential changes and logout revoke backend refresh sessions instead of leaving old refresh tokens usable.\n\nWhat changed:\n- password change now deletes all `user_sessions` rows for the user before returning success\n- password reset now deletes all `user_sessions` rows for the user before returning success\n- new `action=logout` verifies a refresh token and deletes only that matching refresh session\n- revocation helpers preserve the existing `refresh_token_hash` / `token_hash` fallback behavior\n- missing `user_sessions` keeps the existing non-enforced degraded behavior, while real delete failures fail closed\n\nRoot cause: password change and reset only updated `user_profiles.password_hash` and cleared reset fields; logout had no backend refresh-token invalidation path.\n\nAccess-token behavior is intentionally unchanged. Already-issued stateless access tokens can live until normal expiry; this PR revokes refresh sessions only.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath api/auth/__tests__/productionization.test.js`\n- `./node_modules/.bin/eslint api/auth/index.js api/middleware/auth.js api/auth/__tests__/productionization.test.js`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`","created_at":"2026-07-08T09:10:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T09:33:16Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T09:33:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-08T09:33:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"af64a2474a4edf94fd7569bb2e33174f8fffa10e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1477/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1477/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1477/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/a6c74d9282f0ed290c0c92f380079f09afa1e7c7","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/auth-session-revocation","ref":"codex/auth-session-revocation","sha":"a6c74d9282f0ed290c0c92f380079f09afa1e7c7","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://ap